Subject: [M144-LTS] Add DontChangeBaseLevelForNPOTImmutableTextures driver bug
 workaround.

PowerVR GPUs on Android have a bug when changing the BASE_LEVEL of an
immutable NPOT texture created via glTexStorage2D.

This workaround triggers a Context Lost event when changing an immutable
NPOT texture's BASE_LEVEL.

TEST=gpu_unittests

(cherry picked from commit cd7d046effc5d185ae117d18e036deac0fd0427f)

